  "schema_notes": "sign.status is one of: verified | needs_review | no_source_found. sign.is_endonym is true when the video shows the country's own sign for itself, false when it shows an ASL/IS exonym, null when unknown. Populate video_url with an embeddable URL (YouTube embed, mp4, or gif) and set video_type to youtube | mp4 | gif; leave null until a source is confirmed.",
